10-cacb38cea0a3\n---\n\n**Shadow Frontier** at `/home/john/mynotes/shadow_frontier/` (syracuse-confinement repo). Successor to [[project-defect-cocycle-csuite]] per `deterministic_equidistribution_theory/critiques/dc_next_steps.md`. Targets: (1) banded S-unit rigidity, (2) band-crossing certificate, (3) mixed-tower enumeration.\n\n**Proved / certified (as of 2026-06-10):**\n- **Narrow-band dichotomy** (`notes/narrowband.tex`, 4pp): divergent orbits dwell ≤ O(Y^θ(D)) in bands of ratio < 2^{2D*}; full exclusion (incl. cycles, via Baker τ=13.3) at ratio ≲2.1; bounded-discrepancy exclusion complexity-free.\n- **Exact count method** (`search/exact_count.py`, `search/vhires_phase.c`): D-confinement quantizes B_j to ≤⌊2D⌋+1 integers around j·log₂3 ⟹ N_D(p) by rotation-driven bigint recursion, NO discretization. **D\\* = 1.246, band ratio 5.63** (supersedes δ-grid 1.232/5.5); theorem hypothesis uses exact integer N_D(p), Perron eliminated.\n- **Run-budget/ghost-depth clock** (`notes/runbudget.tex`): maximal b=1 run length = v₂(x+1)−1 EXACTLY, depth −1/step (S(x)+1 = 3(x+1)/2); Target 2 = single renewal coordinate \"no orbit oversamples its own ghost depths forever\". Measured: global depth law = natural 2^{−(g−1)}; ascending windows oversample (mean 3.68 vs 3.01).\n- **Exact (D,ε) phase diagram** (2000×1500×24ω×400t, C/OpenMP ~90s/24 cores, `viz/fig5_phase_diagram_vhires.png`): two arithmetic lines — vertical D\\*=1.246 (counting capacity) and horizontal **binary bias ceiling ε_bin = √(9/196+3(log₂3−19/14)²) = 0.44903** (alphabet capacity: calibrated {1,2}-words can't exceed it; crossing needs b≥3 letters taxed by run-budget clock). Boundary kinks at 2D∈ℤ (window-size jumps) are real; δ-grid scallops were artifacts (|Δθ| median 0.02, max 0.53). ε\\* saturates ≈0.54.\n\n- **Two-clock structure** (`notes/twoclock.tex`, `search/twoclock.py`): letter trichotomy mod 8, b = v₂(x+1/3) — letters are depth readings vs {−1, +1, −1/3}; **+1 clock**: b=2 runs meter the trivial cycle, decrement exactly 2, length ⌊(h−1)/2⌋, parity handoff (h odd→1-run, h even→big letter); alternating parse exact; budget identity 0.585·Σ(g−1) − 0.415·#2 − Σ(b−log₂3). **Unconditional theorems**: depth supply (without replacement, pool 2^{k−g}/band); upcrossings of 2^k ≤ 2^{k−3}; N_{1/2}(p)=1 exactly (one Sturmian word per phase) ⟹ log dwell ≤ 3log₂Y in ratio≤2 bands ⟹ **escape rate: divergent orbit spends O(X log X) lifetime steps below X**. **Target 2 = joint calibration conjecture** (g-law AND P[h odd]→1/3); g-law alone insufficient — (1,1,2)^∞ parity channel ascends, ghost limit −19/11. Ascent fingerprint: E[g] 3.99/3.05, P[h odd] 0.630/0.358, big 0.093/0.235. LTE bridge: handoff h = 1+v₂(3^ℓm−1) lives in the joint (2,3) tower.\n\n- **Universal ghost clock + Chang audit** (`notes/ghostclock.tex`, `search/ghostclock.py`): every signature σ has phantom root ρ = C/(2^K−3^ℓ) (our ghosts −1,+1,−5,−19/11,−17 = exactly these); cylinder threshold K+1; repulsion exactly K bits/block; **ride cap ⌊(a−1)/K⌋ exact**; height cap a ≤ log₂(|2^K−3^ℓ|x+C); band pools 2^{k−g} without replacement for ALL ghosts — **resolves the −19/11/parity-channel question** (K=4 clock). Audit of arXiv:2603.11066v6 (Chang, LLM-collab ms in `docs/`): census formula needs hypothesis γ≤β (counterexample else); their R independently recomputed **R=0.0882 ≤ 0.0893** (4.70× margin); their burst-gap = our two clocks (their k=v₂(n+1)=g, Persistent Exit Lemma = parity handoff h=3, their g\\*=1.71=1/log₂(3/2), their Hyp A/B = our two channels); their **shadow return-time theorem REFUTED** (min gap 1 vs claimed ℓ+K−1; alignment jumps +16/step); their CIC (\"every n₀>1 eventually takes b≥3\") = parity≡1 extreme of our calibration conjecture; balanced core of their C∞ dead by our narrowband corollary.\n\n**Pilot 001:** 120/120 calibrated biased high-complexity candidates = ghosts. Ghost catalog in `catalog/ghost_catalog.tex` (incl. −5, −17 cycle calcs).\n\n- **CIC round chain** (`notes/cic_roundchain.tex`, `sea